/**
 * M4 Slice 9: system-design.md §12.4. "A report is a frozen snapshot, not a
 * saved query" — every figure is computed once by `FinancialReportService.
 * generate()` and stored (`income`/`expenses`/`duesSummary`/`memberCounts`
